'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth V''' is an [[NPC]] on {{Zone|The Mountaintop}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. They give the player a {{Skill|Farming}}-related quest outside the Rift in exchange for {{Item|Eleanor's Cap}}.

== Purpose ==

'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth V''' gives the player a [[Farming]] quest that they must complete outside the Rift.

Behind the nearby mirror, a replica of the player is shown farming {{Item|Carrot}}s with a {{Item|Gauss Carrot Hoe}} on {{Zone|The Barn}} while equipped with {{Item|Cropie Armor}} and a {{Lv|1}} {{Item|Elephant Pet|rarity=leg}}.

To complete the quest, all of the following conditions must be met at the same time:
*Wearing a full Armor set of {{Item|Cropie Armor}}, {{Item|Squash Armor}}, {{Item|Fermento Armor}} or {{Item|Helianthus Armor}}
**Though these armor sets are listed as requiring certain {{Skl|Farming}} skill levels to use (ex. Cropie Armor requires {{Skill|Farming|30}}), they can still be worn and used for this quest even if the player's Farming level is below the threshold.
*Equipping an [[Elephant Pet]] or [[Mooshroom Cow Pet]] of {{Legendary}} rarity or higher
*Holding one of the following items:
**{{Item|Euclid's Wheat Sickle}}, {{Item|Gauss Carrot Shovel}}, {{Item|Turing Sugar Cane Cutter}}, {{Item|Newton Nether Warts Hoe}}, {{Item|Pythagorean Potato Shovel}}, or one of their upgrades.
*Being on {{zone|The Barn}} in the carrot field
**Within the coordinates {{coords|134|81|-282}} and {{coords|121|88|-291}}
*Say {{Red|'''Eleanor is the best!'''}}

Once completed, the message "''{{Mctxt|f|You sense a watchful presence...}}''" will appear in chat. The player can then return to '''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth V''' to claim {{Item|Eleanor's Cap}}.

